					"documentation" : "@dev Private function to remove a token from this extension's ownership-tracking data structures. Note that\r\nwhile the token is not assigned a new owner, the _ownedTokensIndex mapping is _not_ updated: this allows for\r\ngas optimizations e.g. when performing a transfer operation (avoiding double writes).\r\nThis has O(1) time complexity, but alters the order of the _ownedTokens array.\r\n@param from address representing the previous owner of the given token ID\r\n@param tokenId uint256 ID of the token to be removed from the tokens list of the given address\r",
					"id" : 2479,
					"implemented" : true,
					"isConstructor" : false,
					"isDeclaredConst" : false,
